Description: telescope control and astrophotography from a web browser
 astrolol runs on the computer attached to a telescope (a Raspberry Pi or a
 mini PC) and drives its mount, cameras, focuser, filter wheel and guider.
 Phones, tablets and laptops connect to it with a web browser: imaging,
 plate solving, autofocus, guiding, polar alignment and imaging sequences.
 .
 Devices are reached through INDI, INDIGO, ASCOM Alpaca or astrolol's own
 drivers.

